-&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;伊朗战争大幅提高了燃料价格，促使企业和消费者转向可再生能源和电动汽车。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;今天的时事通讯汇集了最新的研究，在战争结束六个月后，这些研究指出了一系列明显的&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/syVkuBdhIu9J6lUTV8-gh1CH1tGvZaPlcDkUzVQgbFDUGPgYOPSqs6JMR3WId-fYV5bgvv01whSPP-n-2JhSjJUMft41d6joD2l9Lgo30-tRggCPTMSbzv3dUzvuS2TqINhyMxbyeiievv7NfAKzAXHF-uMoNkRHDFcle1TObEfd-WOUKa00unebbPRMUQe5QjWYZOFF6CSCbEcgDmPoA-rIo6Dbu406KISC2ZIDWlOEBtsj_ldXk-jEIAA_coxF4iNsWW6obHfd7nDe0MVcdpmXRqwWRrKcSTqjCT_-AfhiMho9w1E2L5i11tXNquQX3qTTnEHbEIxxSIR0z4A2rp3OrYp43odMLFM9Nzlk2P1lXTP0UsnNp8VkasEQMW8FqP4GmmFyCCqB9YnB-35aM-V4y7W8H8t7OPG-8AYq89FPc4B5Qv6sGxiY7Yv5OdGWJh-cuHjb3-5Lv3GtgTIQf6Erkbt0QEEestLpXBfbHJsSeWquniyQ2SK1xjmfx3vcq8wb98eOxDZmAlLQNl3gBEUJGUF48DXWWBuFYspB3po/tLX-T1OtM_TFdhtJg-zL6QMp55LWSMiA/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="伊朗战争如何重新绘制全球能源版图"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;赢家和输家的出现&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;。一个令人担忧的结果——燃煤发电的激增——并没有实现，清洁能源的扩张速度更快。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;我们还在关注尼泊尔悲惨洪水的后果，并为您带来&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/rtXfx1J9g-6o8pSARceJIOaFgHdsAILQ-LKytrDyg7lTcGD5hQ9SHZUjtUmIUjaeIgKDyuA3DRxZbRF6riG1u-CG1MfHlhhI2IuCAcvzDm0v2RrXbRRVYzu1kv0EDQ2eXu4SdQMIZK7L_jTGYmrnsGJstmh41DlxQCc_seNAtmghbgiFi7Dn5r6FrnEr8gvKHRPV3kaGWh2IAcd6ddfR86AnATwC8kDML3MXAX0JdmbaK0b5JWA47hPE-im3hyg2MacjlXght4cAdB2FIWcwttVa1dzQrfr-hiP5Cj7VSu-Yg6qNusm0u8J35jra6nAlhaVYlATHmCPZsSTSLaxee4ym4NKNpSE4sY8WYeKJXRgsOPmzGLnpRXUxQpg93NcgwGzIoDpEaWAfaHqUJ9IVZHuruI10mTKlHJvuExmQJHwtpgyW2r3ByyrDVemqAL5m22YlQ4-J-8L5DJCGG-VLSOlrk4Ky9b1qD-DUOmlsBBGVfA/339VEmmR94F5aBeyE-w8LlZormJETfyq/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blan